## Recommendations

### Performance
- Consider enabling nested virtualization for development environments
- Monitor ZFS ARC cache usage and adjust if necessary
- Use RAM disks for high-frequency log files

### Security
- Regularly update security packages
- Monitor SSH access logs
- Consider implementing additional security measures

### Maintenance
- Schedule regular system updates
- Monitor disk space usage
- Backup critical configurations regularly

